[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/67772993","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/633#issuecomment-67772993","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/633","id":67772993,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY3NzcyOTkz","user":{"login":"jhnns","id":781746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTc0Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns","html_url":"https://github.com/jhnns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-12-21T15:02:44Z","updated_at":"2014-12-21T15:02:44Z","body":"If the expression of the `if`-block can be statically resolved, the block will be removed.\n\n``` javascript\nif (false) {\n    // will be removed\n}\n```\n\n``` javascript\nvar expr = false;\n\n...\n\nif (expr) {\n    // will not be removed, because the value of expr\n    // can't be resolved without running the code\n}\n```\n\nWhen you use the `DefinePlugin`, it will replace all occurrences of `someVar` with the given expression.\n\n``` javascript\nnew DefinePlugin({\n    DEBUG: false\n});\n```\n\nWith that config this code\n\n``` javascript\nif (DEBUG) { ... }\n```\n\nbecomes\n\n``` javascript\nif ((false)) { ... }\n```\n\nand thus will be removed.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/67772993/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jhnns","id":781746,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTc0Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781746?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns","html_url":"https://github.com/jhnns","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jhnns/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/67773308","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/633#issuecomment-67773308","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/633","id":67773308,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY3NzczMzA4","user":{"login":"appsforartists","id":926648,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyNjY0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/926648?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists","html_url":"https://github.com/appsforartists","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-12-21T15:13:37Z","updated_at":"2014-12-21T15:15:04Z","body":"Right, but my point is that if, after DefinePlugin, you end up with this:\n\n``` javascript\nif (\"\") {\n  require(\"\");\n}\n```\n\nit should be removed (it's falsy; hence, it can never run), but isn't.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/67773308/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"appsforartists","id":926648,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyNjY0OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/926648?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists","html_url":"https://github.com/appsforartists","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/appsforartists/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"http